                <l xml:id="m-b736de7b-c553-423a-8d26-654223556dea" facs="#m-0559eaae-8afe-4614-8342-ae9c1fd92966" label="text-like">The praise of Easter</l><l xml:id="m-cf39436d-5cc6-4838-8dad-88d698b73726" facs="#m-1644289e-4e86-4234-841b-4be380ddb531" label="ambiguous">77eM</l><l xml:id="m-831cd7ac-643a-4df6-8ccf-d0046f51550f" facs="#m-6697a8e9-a219-458e-bfd4-52de2998e282" label="text-like">paschal candle on a small sand in the middle of the sanctuary and goes</l><l xml:id="m-e2b12b65-84cc-4ddf-8216-62fb65fc7078" facs="#m-24e20311-3e00-4712-a247-3a2d6d1dfce0" label="text-like">to his place; the rest of the servers stand on either side of him.</l><l xml:id="m-c05dad96-cbd0-4aef-923d-7c755f972da5" facs="#m-7204bdb8-e563-4630-be71-7e5a07e84352" label="text-like">Havinɇ first put incense in the thurible, the celebrant tahes the booh from</l><l xml:id="m-1087872a-bef2-4575-b124-e253812c75c1" facs="#m-f1ed2ee1-998a-40a8-9ff0-5d1908c61990" label="text-like">the chief server: then he kneels on the lowest step of the altar, touards the</l><l xml:id="m-7fc661c3-1c4b-42f0-87c2-d5f441c862b7" facs="#m-2108bf17-e630-48f4-92a1-0f58248e5b5c" label="text-like">Epistle side, and sas silenily:</l><l xml:id="m-cf06388b-7fd9-40f5-99aa-52fec1ee0293" facs="#m-aa3e5fbb-1482-4861-9580-9377673f4fc7" label="lyrics-like">Jube, Dómine, benedicere.</l><l xml:id="m-e7fcf0aa-6a62-4b47-a2a3-9e0efed3a279" facs="#m-fc1efe83-3232-46c7-bc03-26b8c95d7a51" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus sit in corde meo, et in! ténter annúntiem suum paschâle</l><l xml:id="m-c66421bb-9e31-4e58-936e-43f3880fe793" facs="#m-d042a709-ae05-4dca-bb58-afc493601878" label="lyrics-like">lábiis meis, ut digne et compe-l praccónium. Amenl.</l><l xml:id="m-7ab78c09-2c21-4577-b03d-f4a6f7ba0bf9" facs="#m-6fadca0b-1d96-4721-879a-34122f0ffa1e" label="text-like">13. After this the deacon Ior the priestl goes to the lectern, which is covered</l><l xml:id="m-d077bf64-f718-457e-aaec-79425abe4214" facs="#m-11de72a5-ef30-462a-9759-f63a06214bbd" label="text-like">uith a vhite cloth, puis the book on it, and censes its he then goes all round</l><l xml:id="m-334bd606-9361-4a61-ba13-591925125606" facs="#m-3d0c01ba-7eb7-408b-bb75-7a2e2845e65e" label="text-like">the paschal candle, censing it'also.</l><l xml:id="m-1f759835-6bc7-4839-8e24-3f04ac2e29b9" facs="#m-1edd70bc-bfc3-470d-9f25-5217129b3008" label="text-like">All now rise, and stand. as for the Gospel; the deacon sings Ior the priest</l><l xml:id="m-ce1b1ff0-935a-4866-9463-dfe7eb7525f4" facs="#m-ab64f91b-c65d-41b2-9d29-e19b3a5a0523" label="text-like">himself sines or readl the solemm Praise of Easter in front of the paschal</l><l xml:id="m-34e24d8a-f9d8-4c0c-b54c-e87ab66d5859" facs="#m-eccf5523-5dc3-4c6d-9d7a-7e08b3e06392" label="text-like">candle and the processional cross, voith the altar on his right and the nave</l><l xml:id="m-524655ce-b446-4004-941f-980622200537" facs="#m-c83e97d9-d249-47a6-a875-8f7e4fe3c00e" label="text-like">of the church on his left.</l><l xml:id="m-31320322-a6ce-43dc-aaa5-10ade13f6852" facs="#m-93afc2f2-e62d-4bc2-81dd-8cd69ff4dde3" label="lyrics-like">Al hold their lighted candles throughout the Exúltet.</l><l xml:id="m-49c00479-90a8-4b1f-9f65-2cfad32e0a84" facs="#m-1a72e1d8-4b3c-4c0c-a3f2-58dfeec84bfc" label="lyrics-like">yxsúltet jam Angélica turba caelórum: exsúltent divina mysté¬</l><l xml:id="m-12ed72ce-2b0a-4d58-b7ef-c3888eb93b66" facs="#m-d660575b-0f36-497a-bb42-6109af84b567" label="lyrics-like">Uria: et pro tanti Regis victória, tuba insonet salutáris.</l><l xml:id="m-56684aff-e3fa-4e32-8e8f-bf548025b6b7" facs="#m-dba8acb0-bcc2-4c55-9898-8209ae1b7ab6" label="lyrics-like">Gáudeat et tellus tantis irradiáta fulgóribus: et aetérni Regis</l><l xml:id="m-431d8c25-0283-4612-8568-c59bbff4f50a" facs="#m-ea56292d-b91d-4dab-b1c7-631b2c17ed86" label="lyrics-like">splendóre illustráta, totius orbis se séntiat amisisse caliginem.</l><l xml:id="m-b4f5ed94-9a16-49af-b90a-0d7d70780179" facs="#m-ce508d09-0771-4636-9380-408fff90541c" label="lyrics-like">Laetétur et mater Ecclésia, tanti lúminis adornáta fulgóribus:</l><l xml:id="m-29707f5c-d070-4c1d-839f-62974f2ac88d" facs="#m-fc8e2341-33f3-4cee-8fa6-6adccb7ffce1" label="lyrics-like">et magnis populórum vócibus haec aula resúltet.</l><l xml:id="m-e65d11cc-ad88-4a39-ab2c-5758b35e5390" facs="#m-36a3f14c-668a-4230-80de-0e1b70e171cf" label="lyrics-like">Quaprópter astántes vos, fratres carissimi, ad tam miram hujus</l><l xml:id="m-b8dd727c-e07a-457a-acaf-925fbd336999" facs="#m-a778827f-2184-498b-9d1e-7436bd252e6d" label="lyrics-like">sancti lúminis claritátem, una mecum, quaeso, Dei omnipoténtis</l><l xml:id="m-ca2e334b-7e2c-43ee-abf8-6d3358d6dac0" facs="#m-93b33da0-2435-4ccb-9341-7f69fa68c786" label="lyrics-like">misericórdiam invocâte. Ut, qui me non meis méritis intra Levitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-749cea27-4f37-4195-86e5-2a44d6f9417a" facs="#m-b2b8e5e7-c809-4ab5-a1d9-68818fb2f6b4" label="lyrics-like">rum númerum. dignátus est aggregáre, lúminis sui claritátem</l><l xml:id="m-b5438b7f-20b6-4308-bfca-dedef6850fab" facs="#m-6f5f545a-858d-4c67-9688-0457a5a6dc13" label="lyrics-like">infúndens, Cérei hujus laudem implére perficiat.</l><l xml:id="m-499ee63d-be26-4ef3-9abe-1dd77762a286" facs="#m-6843175e-a3be-4f0c-9a95-0744fd515dd6" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Christum Filium suum: Qui cum</l><l xml:id="m-0d926dfd-5fcc-4060-a2c9-3ee8611d0384" facs="#m-4428cd17-db09-4b75-8b01-43e4102ca74b" label="lyrics-like">eo vivit et regnat in unitáte Spiritus Sancti Deus...</l><l xml:id="m-2d12f7d6-a93b-4821-af14-121b225db787" facs="#m-be8bc0a1-545d-493f-b3d7-4f3b54ccfa26" label="lyrics-like">ER ómni-a saécu-la saecu-ló-rum. N. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-f3b1e40f-adb9-4f90-b52c-2542b41c6ed7" facs="#m-22dd7094-500b-4ab0-a387-287a87f5009f" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobíscum. N. Et cum spl-ritu tú-o. V. Súrsum</l><l xml:id="m-2704b447-06cd-4904-8470-15ec577f9f7e" facs="#m-ecfc9018-ca7a-462b-9e54-77dcc63fccf0" label="lyrics-like">córda. K. Habémus ad Dóminum. V. Grá-ti-as agámus</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>